{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower Defense game all about strategy, collecting loot and creating fun builds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/a20d641f5e3c45834799f16d82217d68.poster.avif?t=1755093523\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/a20d641f5e3c45834799f16d82217d68.webm?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/a20d641f5e3c45834799f16d82217d68.mp4?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangy TD is all about coming up with different strategies to counter the wide variety of enemies you are going to encounter. Each hero has their own unique set of abilities and <br>items that can be combined into a multitude of powerful builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/f9b6479414a5d0d5b0d8a004f5f1a89f.poster.avif?t=1755093523\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/f9b6479414a5d0d5b0d8a004f5f1a89f.webm?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/f9b6479414a5d0d5b0d8a004f5f1a89f.mp4?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many bosses in the world of Tangeria, each more powerful than the last. <br>Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/9b033a5fd694522b7d8aaad9df252347.poster.avif?t=1755093523\" width=1248 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/9b033a5fd694522b7d8aaad9df252347.webm?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/9b033a5fd694522b7d8aaad9df252347.mp4?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own skilltree filled with abilities and passives. Currently, there are over 30 unique abilities, and more get added every week!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/d22c4df5f3638bf4a8784c4df96cc961.poster.avif?t=1755093523\" width=1248 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/d22c4df5f3638bf4a8784c4df96cc961.webm?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/extras/d22c4df5f3638bf4a8784c4df96cc961.mp4?t=1755093523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Buy, craft &amp; collect Normal, Magic, Rare and Epic items with powerful properties to further enhance your abilities with unique stats. Find strong combinations of items and skills to create the most powerful heroes you have ever seen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music by: NecropolisAD</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2245620?t=1755093523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755093523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245620/e351